只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"see_image tool for DSH: lets text-only models 'see' images by routing them to a configurable vision model (default Zhipu GLM-4V-Flash, free)","id":"gh:1333296783","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-tool-see-image","slug":"guguthecoder/dsh-tool-see-image","topics":["deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","glm","image-recognition","llm","vision","zhipu"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"see_image tool for DSH: lets text-only models 'see' images by routing them to a configurable vision "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"model (default Zhipu GLM-4V-Flash, free)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 👁️ dsh-tool-see-image"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Give your text-only model eyes.**\n`see_image` routes an image to a configurable vision model (defa"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ult: Zhipu GLM-4V-Flash, free) and relays its description back to your DeepSeek Harness session."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> ### 🎖️ Featured in the community **awesome-deepseek-harness-plugins** list."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## ✨ Why"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"DSH's default text-only model (e.g. `deepseek-v4-flash`) **can't see images**. This plugin gives it "},{"id":"p6s2","text":"eyes via a small, free vision model — no local GPU, no image-editing, no changes to your model."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 🚀 Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **`see_image` tool** — pass any image path + a question; get a text description back.\n- **Vision-m"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"odel-agnostic** — any OpenAI-compatible `/chat/completions` endpoint (Zhipu GLM-4V-Flash by default,"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" or SiliconFlow / Qwen2.5-VL, …).\n- **Sandbox-aware** — reads through `ctx.fs`, respecting DSH's san"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"dbox / observation policy.\n- **Bonus paste-to-text** — a patch script that lets you paste an image s"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"traight into the chat and auto-convert it to text."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 📚 Contents"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- How it works\n- Install (DSH web profile)\n- Configuration\n- Uninstall / rollback\n- Implementation n"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"otes\n- Regression test\n- Field notes\n- Paste-to-text relay (bonus)\n- License"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 🔍 How it works"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 📦 Install (DSH web profile)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"1. **Copy the plugin** into your profile directory, e.g.\n`$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/plugins/dsh-tool-se"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"e-image/`\n(`$DSH_HOME` is usually `~/.dsh`)."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"2. **Declare the dependency** in `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/package.json`:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Then run `pnpm install` (creates a junction to the source under\n`profiles/node_modules`)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"3. **Compose it into the profile** in `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"4. **Set your API key**: create one at the Zhipu (bigmodel) console\n(format `id.secret`), then set t"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"he environment variable (Windows example):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**Restart your terminal**, then **restart `dsh web`** (the web profile does not\nhot-reload patch lay"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"minal**, then **restart `dsh web`** (the web profile does not\nhot-reload patch layers yet — tested)."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"5. **Verify**: in a new session the `see_image` tool should appear. Try it:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration (tool-see-image line in cordis.patch.yml)"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Key | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| `baseURL` | `https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4` | OpenAI-compatible endpoint; the plugin append"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"s `/chat/completions` |\n| `apiKeyEnv` | `ZHIPU_API_KEY` | Env var name that holds the API key |\n| `m"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"odel` | `glm-4v-flash` | Vision model id (free on Zhipu) |\n| `maxTokens` | `1024` | Max output token"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"s. **Note: glm-4v-flash caps at 1024** (higher returns 400 `max_tokens参数非法`; raise it if you switch "},{"id":"p27s5","text":"to a bigger model) |\n| `timeoutMs` | `60000` | Request timeout |\n| `maxBytes` | `15728640` (15MB) | "},{"id":"p27s6","text":"Per-image size limit |\n| `prompt` | (Chinese detailed-description instruction) | Default question; t"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"he `question` argument takes precedence |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"To use a different vision API, change these three keys, e.g. SiliconFlow:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## 🗑️ Uninstall / rollback"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"1. Remove the `- insert: ... tool-see-image ...` block from `cordis.patch.yml`;\n2. Remove the juncti"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"on: `Remove-Item profiles\\node_modules\\dsh-tool-see-image`;\n3. Remove that line from `profiles/web/p"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ackage.json` dependencies;\n4. Restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## 🧠 Implementation notes (for plugin developers)"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- Exports `{ name, inject, Config, apply }`, same shape as every DSH tool plugin;\n- `inject: [\"tools"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"\", \"fs\"]` — the tool registry and the sandboxed file service\nare both Host-global services;\n- Regist"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"ered at the global layer, so every session sees it (same as TUI-mode\nhost tool rows);\n- Reads files "},{"id":"p33s4","text":"through `ctx.fs` (sandbox/observation policy applied), never raw\n`node:fs`;\n- Parameter schema uses "},{"id":"p33s5","text":"the DSH-specific format: `required: true` for required,\n**omit the `required` key** for optional (`r"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"equired: false` is rejected by\n`defineTool`);\n- Network request carries a timeout and `exec.signal` "},{"id":"p33s7","text":"cancellation; errors are\nmodel-readable."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## 🧪 Regression test"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"`test/mount-test.mjs` mounts this plugin line under a real Cordis Loader\n(timer + system-prompt + to"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ols + this plugin) and asserts that `see_image`\nlands in the tool registry. Run:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Expected output: `tools.schemas() 含 see_image: true` and `=== MOUNT TEST PASS ===`.\nThe script tempo"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"rarily links the plugin into the checkout's node_modules\n(Windows junction / other-platform symlink)"},{"id":"p37s3","text":" and cleans up afterwards — no\nhardcoded local paths."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## 📝 Field notes"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- 2026-08-13: real key + `triz-workflow.png` (a DSH Web GUI screenshot) →\nHTTP 200 in ~6.8s, correct"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ly read the UI text (search box / MCP settings /\nFetch / Filesystem / Sequential-Thinking).\n- Pitfal"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"l: glm-4v-flash's `max_tokens` cap is 1024 (the default of 2048 caused\na 400; the default has been f"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"-4v-flash's `max_tokens` cap is 1024 (the default of 2048 caused\na 400; the default has been fixed)."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## 📋 Paste-to-text relay (bonus)"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Beyond the `see_image` tool (which reads an image *by path*), this repo ships a\n**patch script** tha"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"t lets you **paste images straight into the chat box** and\nhave them auto-converted to text:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"It patches three DSH packages (host-apiproxy, llm-deepseek, client-ui) so that:\n- the UI shows the p"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"asted image (the hidden text block is filtered out);\n- DeepSeek receives a `【图片：...】` description fr"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"om GLM-4V-Flash instead of raw pixels;\n- repeated images hit a local cache (`~/.dsh/cache/image-rela"},{"id":"p43s4","text":"y/`), and failures\ndegrade gracefully within 8s."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Requires `ZHIPU_API_KEY`. The image cache itself is portable and stays under\n`~/.dsh/cache/image-rel"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"ay/`; only the DSH checkout must be supplied explicitly.\n**Re-run the script after any `npx` dsh upg"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"rade** —\nthe patch is lost when the npm cache is refreshed."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
